  gallery+='<section class="wrap section narrow"><div class="eyebrow">BEFORE YOU BUY</div><h2>Files, use & <em>delivery.</em></h2><details><summary>What is included?</summary><p>Two complete 46-page PDFs and a quick-start text file: a writable US Letter edition and an ink-friendly A4 print edition. The PDFs are in English, undated, and licensed for personal use. No physical product is shipped.</p></details><details><summary>Can I type into it?</summary><p>The digital edition has 122 writable PDF fields. Use a form-capable PDF reader and save a personal copy. Test one answer, save, close and reopen before starting. Some browser and mobile previews do not reliably retain form answers. Keep longer entries on the extra notes pages or in your own notebook.</p></details><details><summary>Can I print it?</summary><p>Yes. The A4 print edition has a white cover and ruled writing areas. Print at actual size on A4 or use Fit for another paper size, checking the print preview first. You may reprint it for your own personal use.</p></details><details><summary>How will the paid download arrive?</summary><p>'+('After a successful Payhip checkout, use the download page and the download link in your email receipt. Keep the receipt for access and support.' if checkout else 'Paid checkout is not open yet. The prepared delivery flow uses Payhip: after a successful purchase, buyers will receive a download page and an email receipt with download access. We will enable purchases after the seller connection and delivery tests pass.')+'</p></details><details><summary>Is this therapy or personalized advice?</summary><p>No. It is a guided self-reflection and organization resource. It does not diagnose, treat or replace qualified medical, mental-health or financial support.</p></details></section>'
